facts.toolchain:
Flutter is NOT on PATH. Prefix every Flutter/Dart command with:
$env:Path = "C:\flutter\bin;$env:Path";
Flutter 3.44.4, Dart 3.12.2, Node 24. Firebase CLI not installed (use npx, see TOOLS).

orchestrator.finding_format:
### {ID} {Title}
- Severity: {P0|P1|P2|P3} | Confidence: {High|Medium|Low}
- Location: `path:line`[, `path:line`]
- Evidence: one code line or command output, max 5 lines, in a fenced block
- Why it matters: {input or state} -> {wrong result}
- Fix: {specific change: function, file, behavior}
- Effort: {S|M|L|XL}

steps.s:
Task card format (exactly):
      #### {Task id e.g. T4.07} {Title}
      - Findings: {ids}
      - Files: {paths}
      - Steps: {numbered, concrete edits}
      - Tests: {test file and test name to add or change}
      - Verify: {tool ids from TOOLS, e.g. ANALYZE, TEST_PKG(packages/protocol_brain)}
      - Commit: {conventional commit subject}
      - Effort: {S|M|L}
      - Depends on: {task ids or none}
